 "notes": "Exclusion limit derived from absence of spectral irregularities in X-ray observations of Hydra A using Chandra data. The constraint applies to very light pseudo-Nambu-Goldstone bosons. Data extracted from Figure 4 (95% CL contour). The constraint is most competitive for ALP masses below 7\u00d710^-12 eV, with limit g\u03b3a < 8.3\u00d710^-12 GeV^-1. A small region around 8\u00d710^-12 eV shows weaker constraint due to matching with effective photon mass in plasma. Constraint rises as m_a^2 at higher masses as critical energy exceeds Chandra's observable range.",
